OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAI app ads promoting 'objectification
OL,4,Aof women' banned by watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the ads used sexualised images
OL,7,Fof a girl under 18 to promote an AI
OL,8,Fcompanion app - while others invited
OL,9,Fusers to upload images of their "crush"
OL,10,Fand turn images into "sizzling" videos.
OL,12,FMeta had already removed the offending
OL,13,Fads. But Nicky Baker of the ASA said
OL,14,Fsuch content had the potential "to
OL,15,Fcause real-world harm".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
